    "biography": {
      "concept": "Clerk of the Gate, a former coastal archivist (Act 3)",
      "notes": "Pernelle Oday is Clerk of the Gate. She once catalogued the coastal archives and has never quite come back from it. She is precise and unhurried, reads everything twice, and keeps her hands flat on the table while she does. She pushes paper she does not like away from herself with one finger and won't say why until she's asked directly."
